# BEAT 9 — the manager: a rollup, then "tell the agents working on X to do Y".
Output .work/out/09-manager.mp4
Source .work/head.tape
Hide
Source .work/stage.tape
Show
Sleep 1500ms

Type "@manager what's still outstanding?"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 6s

Type "@manager tell the agents working on the api to add a metrics counter"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 14s
